The .onnx files in this directory are format conversions of the MiniFASNet
anti-spoofing weights from Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing.

    Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing
    Copyright (c) 2020 MiniVision (minivision-ai)
    https://github.com/minivision-ai/Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Derived files and their upstream sources:

    2.7_80x80_MiniFASNetV2.onnx      <- 2.7_80x80_MiniFASNetV2.pth
    4_0_0_80x80_MiniFASNetV1SE.onnx  <- 4_0_0_80x80_MiniFASNetV1SE.pth

Converted by tools/convert_minifas.py. The conversion changes the container
format only. The weights, the network architecture, the two-scale crop (2.7x
and 4.0x of the face box, resized to 80x80) and the summed softmax outputs are
all upstream's work, and liveness.py reproduces their preprocessing rather than
reinventing it - including the detail that their ToTensor is their own class and
does NOT rescale pixels to 0-1.

